  "notes": "12 files emitted at hard cap. § Objective → App.tsx + planner.ts (7-meal week plan). § I/O contract → types.ts (Day/ShoppingItem/PlanResult), BudgetForm.tsx (budget+familySize inputs), MealPlan.tsx (days[]), ShoppingList.tsx (shoppingList[]). § Success criteria → ShoppingList shows pass/fail vs. budget; planner returns all 7 distinct meals. TODOs: smarter cost-optimised meal selection (planner.ts) and ingredient quantity/unit fields (ShoppingList.tsx) — PDD did not specify implementation depth for these."
}
